  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在北平整整待了三年半，除去年冬天丢了一个亲人是一件不可弥补的损失外，别的一切，感谢照例应该说感谢上苍或上帝，但现在都不知应该说谁好了，只好姑且从阙吧总算平平安安过去了。",
      "output_sha256": "b4bc9836a1e7c94c50e5af5046749d97f5bc963ed70e87a1f65a03633dfea9cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4bc9836a1e7c94c50e5af5046749d97f5bc963ed70e87a1f65a03633dfea9cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这三年半是中国多事的时候，但是我始终没离开北平一步，也总算是幸福了，虽然我只想到了个人。",
      "output_sha256": "2f576fbf5798f9e696041af2b8e2c7f53f87e3cc3f67227064f1bb52c1897efb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f576fbf5798f9e696041af2b8e2c7f53f87e3cc3f67227064f1bb52c1897efb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在我，也许可以说在我们这一些人吧，北平实在是意想中中国唯一的好地方。",
      "output_sha256": "63bd83ea70e3b083df3e27088dbb33e96531ccd12f0d307f634b1aa5865354d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "63bd83ea70e3b083df3e27088dbb33e96531ccd12f0d307f634b1aa5865354d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "几年前周启明先生就写过，北平是中国最好的居住的地方，孙春台先生也有《北平乎》一文，称颂北平的好处：这几年时代是大变了，但是我的意见还是和他们一样。",
      "output_sha256": "fe7b0dc25286d0a8577e2f22e07611a2c058e419caa60683c4171690778ac648",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "fe7b0dc25286d0a8577e2f22e07611a2c058e419caa60683c4171690778ac648",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个地方的好处，也和一个人一件东西的相同，平时不大觉得，到离开或丢失时，便一桩桩一件件分明起来了。",
      "output_sha256": "095daa4b9dee98ae5942057373f188241d17c2162c5ebc84fd2f9a331ebe4ea3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "095daa4b9dee98ae5942057373f188241d17c2162c5ebc84fd2f9a331ebe4ea3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我现在来说几句北平的好话，在你们北平住着的，或者觉得可笑，说我多此一举吧？",
      "output_sha256": "3238fb04c3225e37a8b8ef3f7f9f2f74c236bf1fa31e52f1a76250d7df34439c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "3238fb04c3225e37a8b8ef3f7f9f2f74c236bf1fa31e52f1a76250d7df34439c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平第一好在大。",
      "output_sha256": "e1507a6128d80b88c5f2139a2725fef641b65ed92a638ce3e5e5d1f52e0c09c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "e1507a6128d80b88c5f2139a2725fef641b65ed92a638ce3e5e5d1f52e0c09c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从宏伟的宫殿到住宅的庭院，再到槐树和柳树下的道路。",
      "output_sha256": "44e58edd62c7b110c858833660199f05a767d540cac11466294601bd571384ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.688026,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b4797b8751083de3585f8c10acad6cb5fba246fe21188f5976e0e438519d158f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44e58edd62c7b110c858833660199f05a767d540cac11466294601bd571384ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一个北方朋友去南方后回来时感慨：“那样的天井我真受不了！”",
      "output_sha256": "4999d10dd443c3517a52b4a6863838ee43dd8ecbbd1d40babfb92b6269e34bc1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.649899,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dad5365899fc852644a756f61db165b7c71482252d93ad7bba59f047ec75da46"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4999d10dd443c3517a52b4a6863838ee43dd8ecbbd1d40babfb92b6269e34bc1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其实南方许多地方的逼得人喘不出气儿的街道，也是北平生人受不了的。",
      "output_sha256": "9990c3af063d2447dfb950991778749a30d51673cd48b5ca3a77eeaba1be0791",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "9990c3af063d2447dfb950991778749a30d51673cd48b5ca3a77eeaba1be0791",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至于树木，不仅数量庞大，而且种类繁多；有人从飞机上俯瞰，称北平为一片绿色的海洋。",
      "output_sha256": "e49e28f9b49c4dc6284b44f82c7ccb94186077a25e4117b9440a0d51bab336c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.552943,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6948264e15cea94b3b4f66c0b44c0665ae6384e829ae374f2af1b5e8f7a92abf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e49e28f9b49c4dc6284b44f82c7ccb94186077a25e4117b9440a0d51bab336c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个人到北平来住，不知不觉中眼光会宽起来，心胸就会广起来；我常想小孩子最宜在北平养大，便是为此。",
      "output_sha256": "1c657977785285e5ec89e94a4a41d1abd1e9b76c7602c663fc8d53f59a114688",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "1c657977785285e5ec89e94a4a41d1abd1e9b76c7602c663fc8d53f59a114688",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平之所以大，因为它做了几百年的首都；它的怀抱里拥有各地各国的人，各色各样的人，更因为这些人合力创造或输入的文化。",
      "output_sha256": "5927a553981ccefaca075b6774b1768f6dc2f868db541b3999bb1ad5f716747c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "5927a553981ccefaca075b6774b1768f6dc2f868db541b3999bb1ad5f716747c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "虽然上海也是个五湖四海的人聚集地，但它主要是以工商业为主，往往让人觉得嘈杂和浑浊。",
      "output_sha256": "e8043770eec4eb55107407267314e19f2d07c06cd1a886ec2aa492caa197f4fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.401898,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9fc97cf9779d96d4b9a586c46e15e339cbbd45f7860459b3d479d3745307e57f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e8043770eec4eb55107407267314e19f2d07c06cd1a886ec2aa492caa197f4fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "上海人有的是聪明，狡猾；但宽大是他们不懂得的。",
      "output_sha256": "3ae20234732edfced61816e36b159a5fd2eeee751c6755a7dcaa352405eb36fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ae20234732edfced61816e36b159a5fd2eeee751c6755a7dcaa352405eb36fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平第二好在深。",
      "output_sha256": "230b301b2fe1bd2cd6522d4391be9d57788bfc95ff0095a70dc1c399fc489822",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "230b301b2fe1bd2cd6522d4391be9d57788bfc95ff0095a70dc1c399fc489822",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们都知道北平书多。",
      "output_sha256": "bce16c4b33dded93a184a0930bdafbdec3e108b34904bdf21e33bb3fbdbce1bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "bce16c4b33dded93a184a0930bdafbdec3e108b34904bdf21e33bb3fbdbce1bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们都知道北平的书籍数量庞大，但除了书籍，还有许多珍贵的文化遗产，如书画、铜器、石刻、拓片，甚至瓷器和玉器等，公家的收藏非常丰富，私人收藏也各有特色。",
      "output_sha256": "1d1acd20326eb5d08c2508da6f267e87367d5b334909a992da3224b90061c9bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.532055,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bcb54119e2eb11ef08ec696ad9774b504f993c75bd43186b63c347a7c88c8146",
        "577576338f2377298c583779427af0c0b09d56f94a3ee787df423ace2289b133"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1d1acd20326eb5d08c2508da6f267e87367d5b334909a992da3224b90061c9bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17,
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而内阁的大库档案则是极为珍贵的近代史料，众所周知。",
      "output_sha256": "691b86ba952361d6ce5a1754d0aae9d68538c464ae0f92529e093c39ac308180",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.532055,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bcb54119e2eb11ef08ec696ad9774b504f993c75bd43186b63c347a7c88c8146",
        "577576338f2377298c583779427af0c0b09d56f94a3ee787df423ace2289b133"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "691b86ba952361d6ce5a1754d0aae9d68538c464ae0f92529e093c39ac308180",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17,
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "中国的历史、语言、文学和美术的文物在北平荟萃；这些领域的人才也大多集中于此。",
      "output_sha256": "dcdfda8616f3ccb7f6ba8f61fda728d3c48b76aab085f97b13942eeeeaf652a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.634323,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "75b5d15660c446733e65b6f32ebcf58e1073e88ae1436796a5ca1e73ad2857d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dcdfda8616f3ccb7f6ba8f61fda728d3c48b76aab085f97b13942eeeeaf652a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平的深，在最近的将来，是还不可测的。",
      "output_sha256": "4426031d44d4241f1487d6e868ea9d14b6c48f8f99edfb2ea245610f32739d76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "4426031d44d4241f1487d6e868ea9d14b6c48f8f99edfb2ea245610f32739d76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "胡适之先生说过，北平的图书馆有这么多，上海却只有一个，还不是公立的。",
      "output_sha256": "abebb074ae8dba2936e5a96171f22982733ed6452307f8fb5c2fd0512e2ae028",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "abebb074ae8dba2936e5a96171f22982733ed6452307f8fb5c2fd0512e2ae028",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这也是北平上海重要的不同。",
      "output_sha256": "a5055aa5a718973694cf4a567753379c52f8d9a482bc329b5e70d39a3e3a0aeb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "a5055aa5a718973694cf4a567753379c52f8d9a482bc329b5e70d39a3e3a0aeb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平第三好在闲。",
      "output_sha256": "b9fe1894754540096a92455568f79ef6e3041fbdd631523b435e780a674d21f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9fe1894754540096a92455568f79ef6e3041fbdd631523b435e780a674d21f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果说上海代表了现代，那么北平则象征着古代。",
      "output_sha256": "316cbe2c6f5bfabbe1efa7b2d1fdab4eed3ad3c771c8f7bb425a0994a92663d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.439508,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b231b44b881daab37e65ee9d3a4a2fbc8ee98522d2210aafa40c89abc14a014d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "316cbe2c6f5bfabbe1efa7b2d1fdab4eed3ad3c771c8f7bb425a0994a92663d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "北平的一切都透着一种悠然自得的气息。",
      "output_sha256": "dc06797135f0b1a3d2a3a197b2b61d46a98a373c12b47d650afb11b593d937ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.573463,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dbce43d4837cd23474b53821bb0e5cd2a2b6b32006b7b46fc011dc3bed53f3a8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dc06797135f0b1a3d2a3a197b2b61d46a98a373c12b47d650afb11b593d937ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "即如电车吧，在上海是何等地风驰电掣，有许多人上下车都是跳的。",
      "output_sha256": "201e1d47e214e11d724ac25872e402be79f471076b887c8bacc5112ea663e89c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "201e1d47e214e11d724ac25872e402be79f471076b887c8bacc5112ea663e89c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平的车子在宽阔的路上走着，似乎一点也不忙。",
      "output_sha256": "dfbd4d44cbbb843f7b668ddb2cde76611ff9b1efe79b58a887cfc1fe526309c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfbd4d44cbbb843f7b668ddb2cde76611ff9b1efe79b58a887cfc1fe526309c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "晚上九点以后，车速确实快了起来，但车上只剩下稀稀落落的几个人，仿佛是在乘坐汽车兜风，依旧感受不到急促的气息。",
      "output_sha256": "d40319a39d97ee5f5c1e1c21325a250a217acc9b09ff75f4095f36e165423367",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.50475,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c46ab0cb4ea2ebffb4eadbe8cf0cb8a9691805a87f38fed536edde80473326cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d40319a39d97ee5f5c1e1c21325a250a217acc9b09ff75f4095f36e165423367",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26,
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有时从东长安街的槐林旁驶过，茂密的树木和稀疏的灯光交相辉映，令人倍感飘渺。",
      "output_sha256": "f607908eb74c2dc4192673f75db574e330d739d6fde8bf28e86f2150e2e641fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.50475,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c46ab0cb4ea2ebffb4eadbe8cf0cb8a9691805a87f38fed536edde80473326cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f607908eb74c2dc4192673f75db574e330d739d6fde8bf28e86f2150e2e641fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26,
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平真正的闲人其实也很少，但大家骨子里总有些闲味儿。",
      "output_sha256": "071447835d4cfdba1c7ea77a39176b28c740433db9072c36f0875c9d5fb96343",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "071447835d4cfdba1c7ea77a39176b28c740433db9072c36f0875c9d5fb96343",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也喜欢近代的忙，对于中古的闲却似乎更亲近些。",
      "output_sha256": "006015b6ffbd8499c34a3c46c183df8275f6f5e5e073c3661e57b3905403ccc0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "006015b6ffbd8499c34a3c46c183df8275f6f5e5e073c3661e57b3905403ccc0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "或许这就是我在北平待得太久的缘故吧。",
      "output_sha256": "5b9dff4c09c5a428ed37f5fbfcb05840b6041bd583c6f07bd2a476a23a68db18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.600176,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2acc5730cf631fd6dca5426ab97c0a998c8b42b515bb024fef1b9284405eefa9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5b9dff4c09c5a428ed37f5fbfcb05840b6041bd583c6f07bd2a476a23a68db18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "写到这里，我觉得自己似乎忘记了时代。",
      "output_sha256": "7acd61c6bf4adce58f96ec2d674fc9afcecae5b453f6ea4d76b580033362ce85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.704038,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4f77e2c176eb6f66ef190bb4369db957465b90a747ba254a94456cbf9f492a02"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7acd61c6bf4adce58f96ec2d674fc9afcecae5b453f6ea4d76b580033362ce85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我所称赞的似乎只是封建的遗存，是“布尔”或小“布尔”的玩意儿；而现在据说非“普罗”起来不可，这可有点儿为难。",
      "output_sha256": "00779e9ecf9d7ff7e2d4881513345e7d59534f163774c1acb2f02f0949d6c312",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "00779e9ecf9d7ff7e2d4881513345e7d59534f163774c1acb2f02f0949d6c312",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我实在爱北平，我所爱的北平是如上面说的。",
      "output_sha256": "da202494d8df064291f06b7bb3dbed6af0e21938a0655afe233e677ba25711ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "da202494d8df064291f06b7bb3dbed6af0e21938a0655afe233e677ba25711ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我没有或不能“获得”“普罗”的“意识形态”，我也不能“克服”我自己；结果怕只该不说话或不说真话。",
      "output_sha256": "8b83725dad9418de2c4d4a35e09beb7774ae42cc22b50bfb7cc150aeba4c51f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b83725dad9418de2c4d4a35e09beb7774ae42cc22b50bfb7cc150aeba4c51f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不说话本来没有什么不可以，不过说话大约在现在也还不能就算罪过吧；至于撒谎，则我可以宛转地说，“我还没有那种艺术”，或干脆地说，“我还没有那种勇气！”",
      "output_sha256": "9c8c74c1c79a9b9e604cd9399631d712a73dc22f5ab6aefd765fb81a5c084095",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c8c74c1c79a9b9e604cd9399631d712a73dc22f5ab6aefd765fb81a5c084095",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不过幸运的是，我这篇通信是写给朋友们的，分享我的真实感受，或许还是可以的。",
      "output_sha256": "6afbe347d41c9eb69257a64baf20394f3726f8a943474487f40d7a31e2135a68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.466387,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b25fef9d84e0232dbdb2e2ad8a7c578f15f6210fc8ab66b60f585650319f89a9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6afbe347d41c9eb69257a64baf20394f3726f8a943474487f40d7a31e2135a68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我现在是一个人在北平，这回是回到老家去。",
      "output_sha256": "afb219055e1e822f60b40fefd159b06b496e188d6ee132d6e9a46ef29c537a08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "afb219055e1e822f60b40fefd159b06b496e188d6ee132d6e9a46ef29c537a08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我一点不觉着是回家，一切都像出门作客似的。",
      "output_sha256": "06401ee8b124661c91b025b68fd607937c70a1ce882ab149a689bb4dbfef65a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "06401ee8b124661c91b025b68fd607937c70a1ce882ab149a689bb4dbfef65a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平已成了我精神上的家，没有走就想着回来；预定去五个礼拜，但想着南方的天井，潮湿，和蚊子，也许一个月就回来了。",
      "output_sha256": "00ce3cb06b1e6d16ec73ebf9b591e7125f7f3f9978c7075eb56dc92cd4a9b283",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "00ce3cb06b1e6d16ec73ebf9b591e7125f7f3f9978c7075eb56dc92cd4a9b283",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说到潮湿，我在动身这一天，却有些恨北平。",
      "output_sha256": "dde7bd4471041834bc63ba6a38a3305201da36ed8d64aeb8c49f765f66134252",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "dde7bd4471041834bc63ba6a38a3305201da36ed8d64aeb8c49f765f66134252",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "每年夏季，北平照例是要有几回大雨的，往往连下几天不止。",
      "output_sha256": "81dc6a8bc78b9287119a09ea65a524d95a59e1ce36967a464664a65e961c34ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "81dc6a8bc78b9287119a09ea65a524d95a59e1ce36967a464664a65e961c34ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "前些日子在一个宴会里，有人问我到什么地方避暑去；我回答说要到上海去；他知道上海不是避暑的地方。",
      "output_sha256": "5e352861ad1a85c0162a0fd5d920bb4c3bdfb3e6ca84a45db86d1b21b73ac7a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "5e352861ad1a85c0162a0fd5d920bb4c3bdfb3e6ca84a45db86d1b21b73ac7a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我却知道他是需要避暑的，就问，是北戴河么？",
      "output_sha256": "2166370d2ef3c729dd3f972fb5d97f58a8adfa7a616971023d97b1e428841678",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "2166370d2ef3c729dd3f972fb5d97f58a8adfa7a616971023d97b1e428841678",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他答应后说：北平太热了，且雨快要来了，真没意思！",
      "output_sha256": "059794a8c28b23ad87cf254e3606ec8133740b569a5d5bbf82b67a627f4d4278",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.676392,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5edafefb283dee1df66aebc277c64a536fdb13d7b9f0a01fed035f73633a33ee"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "059794a8c28b23ad87cf254e3606ec8133740b569a5d5bbf82b67a627f4d4278",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我当时大约说了“是”，但其实并不知道北平夏天的雨究竟有多没意思！",
      "output_sha256": "0e5add237a91b3b4697b3570e1e6def6c89d75c5c3293807c93e94a429fb0dae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.784269,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ef9138bcac583fc926273f54f97f0acf206d6bfd6dcd0d475647f1d3a3fe874a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0e5add237a91b3b4697b3570e1e6def6c89d75c5c3293807c93e94a429fb0dae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我去年曾坐在一间大屋中看玻璃窗外的夏雨，又走到廊下看院中的流水，觉得也还有些意思的。",
      "output_sha256": "2c4ef250be2378fdee04b9101c8f9175e5130c903c3bf1f182621a116a914a18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c4ef250be2378fdee04b9101c8f9175e5130c903c3bf1f182621a116a914a18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而这次却让我感到无比苦恼。",
      "output_sha256": "fe833f6cae8d1301227616fa3d9a4f96ba8edcacccd5f95a2bcefd6325f421f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.276648,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d0d56640e8cfe1d3dd8b1cc13b35c694796e1adf4c1cd8201ed278caebedbb3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fe833f6cae8d1301227616fa3d9a4f96ba8edcacccd5f95a2bcefd6325f421f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不先不后，今夏的雨期恰在我动身这天早晨起头！",
      "output_sha256": "e4e045d63f3924d93735f3a0fc856a2c9feb4772962894a8d429aec7587abcd5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4e045d63f3924d93735f3a0fc856a2c9feb4772962894a8d429aec7587abcd5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那种滂沱大雨，对坐在大屋中的我来说或许没什么影响，但对于正在准备开始已然陌生的旅行生活的我来说，却无疑是一种折磨。",
      "output_sha256": "b3d5b638739a115de9ebf525aa777a98d787bfaf40c0efb50c882b06bdf881c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.591858,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f874766fb3297387e55be6952b30ca3bbc0c52dd0fe0005feeb101dc3927c33e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b3d5b638739a115de9ebf525aa777a98d787bfaf40c0efb50c882b06bdf881c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我这样从西郊淋进了北平城，在恨恨中睡了一觉。",
      "output_sha256": "a1602228ef5e41bf463775516605809563858e7a4b7ccba570d713aa65fd7ae0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1602228ef5e41bf463775516605809563858e7a4b7ccba570d713aa65fd7ae0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "醒来时雨已停歇，我便带着这些阴郁的情绪，搭乘早车前往天津。",
      "output_sha256": "ccb2819e798a98a7a640baa979b26f7e6d13ad08d58446975944ab7d0d81083b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.659252,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b5ec851e27ff925af3561300424aebef9a6bbffb28b6a087c7da025985cd80d9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ccb2819e798a98a7a640baa979b26f7e6d13ad08d58446975944ab7d0d81083b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "七月十日，天津丸中",
      "output_sha256": "eed735aaca1576f364d4826834a440ba17c8ea86b1a0ca11ea719e06fd0812f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "eed735aaca1576f364d4826834a440ba17c8ea86b1a0ca11ea719e06fd0812f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "某君南去之际，我请他写点通信回来，现在附上这篇“草”，希望能源源而来。",
      "output_sha256": "29afa05bb548360216c378526af8a9e0ca4beee5ca21c7b3d4672c3b39c9d2af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.680747,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b6acec42eb705d056251cd1d9fb64b096fd597fdfeb208d3d168f2a97ea3a376"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "29afa05bb548360216c378526af8a9e0ca4beee5ca21c7b3d4672c3b39c9d2af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他赶大暑中往江南去，将以受了热而怪张怪李，却难说。",
      "output_sha256": "19538cbc09757980153e929e551b16772aff1de8c3a3953f207ac33e916bafa6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "19538cbc09757980153e929e551b16772aff1de8c3a3953f207ac33e916bafa6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此文对于北平，虽怀恋的成分多，颇有相当的平允的。",
      "output_sha256": "90cd8d55a2e2b629208cd73ba51777bb9d346ac727f966dfe9699f5141a8eaa1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "90cd8d55a2e2b629208cd73ba51777bb9d346ac727f966dfe9699f5141a8eaa1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "惟末段引需要避暑的某君的话，咒诅北平的雨，却未必尽然。",
      "output_sha256": "904514bf1a2d19b29036a4d1005813463d5b1c9b718950d1c165f16a4e18f3f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "904514bf1a2d19b29036a4d1005813463d5b1c9b718950d1c165f16a4e18f3f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
